cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it."
type: dataset
title: "Apify Actor Store, captured weekly (wss-apify)"
abstract: >-
  Weekly point-in-time captures of the Apify actor store: usage counters
  (7-, 30- and 90-day active users, total users, total runs), pricing model,
  categories, review and bookmark counts for every actor reachable through the
  public store API. The store publishes only the present -- there is no history
  endpoint, no changelog, and no creation date in the listing -- and an actor
  that is unpublished simply stops being returned. The Internet Archive holds a
  single memento of the store API, containing 949 of the 48,189 actors it
  claimed at the time, so no usage series exists anywhere else. The endpoint
  truncates near offset 15,900 while reporting a total near 66,000, so the sweep
  is partitioned by category and coverage is reported as a count of distinct
  actors rather than as a share of any claimed total.
authors:
